JMeter equivalent:

Extract with JSON Extractor → ${variable} → use in HTTP Request or Header Manager

Example:

HTTP Request URL: /user/${userId}/details
7️⃣ Data-Driven Testing (CSV)

Postman: Use collection runner with CSV/JSON.

JMeter equivalent:

CSV Data Set Config
Steps:
